### Get organization
# Requires make seed. Replace {{org_id}} with the printed organization id.
< {%
    client.global.set('org_id', '<org_id>')
%}

GET http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/{{org_id}}
X-Api-Key: demo-acme-key
Accept: application/json

### Ingest usage (idempotent: replaying the same event_id changes nothing)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/{{org_id}}/usage
X-Api-Key: demo-acme-key
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bytes": 1000000,
  "event_id": "evt-demo-1"
}

### Top-up (raises the quota and re-enables credentials once the org is back under it)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/organizations/{{org_id}}/topups
X-Api-Key: demo-acme-key
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bytes": 5000000
}

### Get credential
< {%
    client.global.set('credential_id', '<credential_id>')
%}

GET http://localhost:8080/api/credentials/{{credential_id}}
X-Api-Key: demo-acme-key
Accept: application/json
